-- event_invite_new_email_he (UPDATE existing V1 → V2)
UPDATE crm_message_templates
   SET body = $V2$<!--
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  SuperSale Event-Invite-New Email — v2 (canon-compliant)
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  CRM slug: event_invite_new_email_he
  Template position: Stage 4 (just-registered lead, event already open — direct invitation)
  Trigger: New lead registers AND there is an active event open for registration
  From: events@prizma-optic.co.il
  Subject: %name%, יש לך אירוע פתוח להרשמה: %event_name%

  Variables in use (CRM substitution syntax):
    %name%                   = lead's full name
    %event_name%             = event name
    %event_date%             = event date (DD/MM/YYYY)
    %event_day_of_week%      = day-of-week derived from event_date (e.g., "יום שישי")
    %event_time%             = event hours (e.g., "10:00 - 18:00")
    %event_max_attendees%    = numeric cap on attendance for this specific event
    %event_deposit_amount%   = deposit amount per event in NIS
    %registration_url%       = unique registration link for this lead
    %unsubscribe_url%        = per-recipient unsubscribe URL

  All tenant values (Prizma) hardcoded inline per Daniel's directive 2026-04-28.
  When tenant 2 onboards, SPEC #11 will plumb {{tenant.*}} variables. Until then: hardcoded.

  Canon: PRIZMA_DESIGN_SYSTEM_CANONICAL.md v1.1 (2026-04-28)
  Copy decisions: COPY_DECISIONS_LOG.md → "Template 5 — event_invite_new_email_he"
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html dir="rtl" lang="he">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>אירוע פתוח להרשמה - אופטיקה פריזמה</title>

  <!-- Rubik web font -->
