  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  SuperSale 2-3 Days Before Event Email — v2 (canon-compliant)
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  CRM slug: event_2_3d_before_email_he
  Template position: Stage 6 (pre-event reminder, 2-3 days out)
  Trigger: 2-3 days before event date, sent to confirmed/reserved attendees only
  From: events@prizma-optic.co.il
  Subject: %name%, נתראה בקרוב באירוע %event_name%

  Variables in use (CRM substitution syntax):
